sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Poller
  participant G as git
  participant I as Indexer
  participant S as Store
  loop every cycle
    P->>G: fetch origin
    G-->>P: new head
  end
  opt head moved
    P->>I: Index(List<File>)
    I->>I: chunk and embed
    I->>S: write chunks
    S--)I: committed
  end
  Note over P,G: a vanished branch is an error
  P-xG: stale ref
  P->S: last_run_at
